sequenceDiagram
    participant HR as 企业HR
    participant Controller as ResumeManageController
    participant Service as ResumeManageService
    participant Dao as ResumeManageDao
    participant MsgService as MessageService

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. 查看收到的简历列表
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, MsgService: 查看收到的简历列表
    HR->>Controller: 进入"收到的简历"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取收到的简历
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询投递给本企业的简历记录
    activate Dao
    Note right of Dao: 筛选条件:<br/>- 关联职位表筛选企业ID<br/>- 支持按投递状态筛选<br/>- 支持按职位筛选<br/>- 支持按投递时间排序
    Dao-->>Service: 返回投递记录列表
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Dao: 批量查询简历详情
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回简历信息
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Dao: 批量查询职位信息
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回职位信息
    deactivate Dao

    Service-->>Controller: 返回简历列表(含状态)
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>HR: 展示简历列表<br/>(简历摘要/投递职位/投递时间/状态)
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. 查看简历详情
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, MsgService: 查看简历详情
    HR->>Controller: 点击查看简历详情
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取收到的简历详情
    activate Service

    Service->>Dao: 校验企业是否有权查看该简历<br/>(确认投递给本企业)
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 验证通过
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Dao: 查询简历完整信息
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回简历详情
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Dao: 更新投递记录的查看状态<br/>(如果之前是PENDING, 改为VIEWED)
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao

    Service-->>Controller: 返回简历详情
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>HR: 展示简历详情页<br/>(可预览附件/导出PDF)
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. 简历筛选操作
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, MsgService: 简历筛选操作
    HR->>Controller: 对简历进行筛选<br/>(合格/待沟通/不合适)
    activate Controller

    alt 标记为"合格"
        HR->>Controller: 点击"合格"
        Controller->>Service: 将简历标记为合格
        activate Service
        Service->>Dao: 校验企业权限
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 验证通过
        deactivate Dao
        Service->>Dao: 更新投递状态为'QUALIFIED'
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service->>MsgService: 通知求职者<br/>"企业已查看简历，标记为合格"
        activate MsgService
        MsgService-->>Service: 通知已发送
        deactivate MsgService
        Service-->>Controller: 操作成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>HR: 提示"已标记为合格"
    else 标记为"待沟通"
        HR->>Controller: 点击"待沟通"
        Controller->>Service: 标记为"待沟通"
        activate Service
        Service->>Dao: 更新投递状态为'PENDING_CONTACT'
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service->>MsgService: 通知求职者<br/>"企业希望与您进一步沟通"
        activate MsgService
        MsgService-->>Service: 通知已发送
        deactivate MsgService
        Service-->>Controller: 操作成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>HR: 提示"已标记为待沟通"
    else 标记为"不合适"
        HR->>Controller: 点击"不合适"
        Controller->>Service: 将简历标记为不合格
        activate Service
        Service->>Dao: 校验企业权限
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 验证通过
        deactivate Dao
        Service->>Dao: 更新投递状态为'REJECTED'<br/>保存拒绝原因
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service->>MsgService: 通知求职者<br/>"企业暂不合适"(可选不透露具体原因)
        activate MsgService
        MsgService-->>Service: 通知已发送
        deactivate MsgService
        Service-->>Controller: 操作成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>HR: 提示"已标记为不合适"
    end
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. 简历收藏
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, MsgService: 简历收藏
    HR->>Controller: 点击"收藏"简历
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 收藏简历
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 检查是否已收藏
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 未收藏
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>Dao: 插入收藏记录
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 收藏成功
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 操作成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>HR: 提示"已收藏"
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 5. 批量导出简历
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, MsgService: 批量导出简历
    HR->>Controller: 勾选多条简历, 点击"导出"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 批量导出简历
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 校验企业权限(批量)
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 验证通过
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>Dao: 批量查询简历详情
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回简历列表
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>Service: 生成Excel/PDF文档<br/>(合并多份简历)
    Service-->>Controller: 返回文件流
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>HR: 下载文件
    deactivate Controller